  decl_routine_err_method_blocks.pcpp - break step of decl_routine.pcpp:
  a const block before a method's begin: a method body takes only var blocks

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_routine_err_method_blocks.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_routine_err_method_blocks.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
